# docs/20 B3 regression (U6, U16, U21). Before: ↑0 always; ※k stayed yellow until the
# reboot; the battery was white down to 10 % although recording stops at 17 %; no SD card
# showed nothing until a recording failed; a long meeting's bar overlapped. Now: no count at
# zero; ※k 10 s; the battery yellow under 30 %, red from 17 %; ※SD; the left group gets what
# the right one leaves (the weekday goes first, then RN, ↑N, ※k, ※SD); the Tab menu's
# Control explains the bar and says √ Synced once nothing waits.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100 lang=zh
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
shot online  online: no ↑0
press tab
press right right
shot control  Control: √ Synced: all on the Mac
press tab
press `+2+tab+w
wait 300
shot ghost  a ghost frame: ※k1
wait 10500
shot ghost-gone  10 s later: gone
usb off
bat 3500
wait 3000
shot battery-yellow  23%: yellow
bat 3440
wait 1500
shot battery-red  16%: red, under the stop line
bat 3700
press g0
type buy milk
press enter
wait 3000
press opt+r
wait 600
press enter
mic 7500000 1500
press `+2+tab+w
wait 300
shot crowded  125 min meeting, offline, ↑1, !1, ※k2: the weekday and RN give way, nothing overlaps
boot store=internal usb=off bat=3700 lang=zh
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
usb off
wait 1500
shot no-sd  booted without a card: ※SD
